      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3516,
      "text": "If We had willed, We could have given every soul its guidance, but My Word[5] will be fulfilled: “I will certainly fill up Hell with jinn and men all together.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 416,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3517,
      "text": "So taste [the punishment] because you forgot the meeting of this Day of yours. We have likewise forgotten you. Taste the eternal punishment for what you used to do.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 416,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3518,
      "text": "The true believers in Our verses are only those who, when they are reminded of them, fall in prostration and glorify their Lord with praise, and they do not show arrogance.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 416,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": {
        "id": 10,
        "recommended": false,
        "obligatory": true
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3519,
      "text": "They forsake their beds, invoking their Lord with fear and hope, and spend[6] out of what We have provided for them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 416,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3520,
      "text": "No soul knows what delights are kept hidden for them as a reward for what they used to do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 416,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3521,
      "text": "Is one who is a believer like one who is an evildoer? They are not equal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 416,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3522,
      "text": "As for those who believe and do righteous deeds, they will have gardens to dwell in, as an accommodation for what they used to do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 32,
        "name": "سُورَةُ السَّجۡدَةِ",
        "englishName": "As-Sajda",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prostration",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 416,
      "ruku": 359,
      "hizbQuarter": 166,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3523,
      "text": "But those who are rebellious, their abode will be the Fire. Every time they try to escape from it, they will be driven back into it, and it will be said to them, “Taste the punishment of the Fire which you used to deny.”",
      "surah": {
